    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d132">

                <pb facs="0243" n="181" xml:id="pg181"/>

                <head>No. 127.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Noyes to Mr. Evarts</hi>.</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Paris</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1878-09-19"><hi rendition="#italic">September</hi> 19,
                        1878</date>. (Received October 3.)</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 141.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I had the honor to telegraph you on the
                    evening of September 16, as follows: <quote rend="blockquote">
                        <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Evarts</hi>, <hi
                                rendition="#italic">Washington:</hi></p>
                        <p>Six thousand dollars, contributed here for yellow fever sufferers, stands
                            to your credit Munroe’s, New York.</p>
                        <p>Please distribute. More will be sent.</p>
                        <p rendition="#right">NOYES.</p>
                    </quote></p>
                <p>On the same evening I received the following reply: <quote rend="blockquote">
                        <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Noyes</hi>, <hi
                                rendition="#italic">Minister, Paris:</hi></p>
                        <p>Telegram received. You have thanks of Department for this public
                            service.</p>
                        <p rendition="#right">EVARTS, <hi rendition="#italic">Secretary.</hi></p>
                    </quote></p>
                <p>I have, &amp;c.,</p>
                <closer><signed>EDWARD F. NOYES.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
